  "note": "Three seats, so \"under your control\" is not collapsed onto the only other player. Karn's -3 exiles alice's Pacifism and, a cycle later, carol's Piker, filing both against Karn (CR 607.2a); alice's Russet Wolves sits in exile linked to nothing. The ultimate exempts only the non-Aura card Karn exiled (CR 728.5): carol's shuffle rebuilds her library without the Piker, Pacifism and the Wolves go back into alice's, and Karn's rider puts the Piker onto the battlefield under bob, its owner unchanged. Each player's library is one basic type so the shuffles can name them; Pacifism and the Wolves are shuffled to the bottom, behind alice's opening seven.",
